    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "<b>dar</b> has an accent only in <b>dé</b> (to tell it apart from the preposition <i>de</i>). <b>deis</b> has no accent.",
        "<b>estar</b> keeps the accents of the present tense: esté, estés, esté, estén. Nosotros and vosotros do not stress the first syllable, but the accent stays on estéis."
      ]
    },
